What is this project?
This project is a Java GUI application for managing stock in car parts shop, it was built as part the project I've been given 

How to set it up?
1.Open IntelliJ IDEA 
2.Create a new Java Project called OOSD1
3.Create a package called Assignment inside the src folder 
4.Copy all the .java files inti the Assignment package
5.Run ShopGUI.java to launch the application

How to use it?
-Use the top section to create a new stock item
-Select a type from the dropdown 
-Fill in the stock code, quantity and price then click Create item
-Use the Stock Actions section to add stock, sell stock, change prices or displa item info

Classes in this project:
-StockItem - the base class for all stock items
-NavSys - a navigation system, extend StockItem
-Tyre - a tyre extends StockItem
-EngineOil - engine oil, extends StockItem
-CarBatter - a car battery extends StockItem
-ShopGUI - te main graphica user interface
-TestNavSys - tests the NavSys class in the console
-TestPolymorphism - demonstrate polymorphism accross all subclasses 
